# auto_splines default-on flip: skip decision (2026-05-17)

## Provenance

- Commit at investigation: `wip(splines): default-on at e8+ — follow-on to W6-2 + W7-4`
- Reference commits: `24f0787` (chunk 2), `f76cbe63` (chunk 3)
- Workspace: `~/work/zen/jxl-encoder--splines-default-on`
- Harness: `jxl-encoder/examples/auto_splines_corpus_bench.rs`
- Default features (includes `butteraugli-loop`)
- Build: release profile, `target/release/examples/auto_splines_corpus_bench`

